   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Three Kartavyas:** The Union Budget 2026-27 rests on three kartavyas (duties): first, speed up and sustain economic growth; second, fulfil people's aspirations and build their capacity, making them partners in India's prosperity; third, in line with **Sabka Saath, Sabka Vikas**, make sure every family, community and region gets access to resources."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 13,
   "sec": 2,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **RE approvals:** The solar, wind-solar hybrid and CBG projects were approved under the **AP Clean Energy Policy**, through **NREDCAP** and **APTRANSCO**."
  }
